{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-7","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-7"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-talk-403810501-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-7","missionId":"event-rogue-7","mission":"소각공","scene":"소각공","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"정적이 감도는 동굴 속, 허공에 도약하는 벌레 덩어리가 마치 무지개 별 같다. 동굴 안에 잠든 여인의 발 곁에는 노블레스 벌레들이 기어 다니고 *회백질*처럼 아무런 색깔이 없는 피부를 하고 있다","talkId":403810501,"textHash":"5545744274192585585","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:7/talk-403810501","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"074dd5d51512be8d","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-talk-403810502-line"],"bwikiPage":"焚化工","bwikiRevision":58640,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9305","bwikiMission":"소각공"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-talk-403810502-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-7","missionId":"event-rogue-7","mission":"소각공","scene":"소각공","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"눈을 뜨고 당신을 발견한 그녀의 곁에 일순간 무지갯빛 화염이 번쩍인다. 동굴 벽을 타고 온 불이 빠르게 발밑을 감싸더니 당신은 곧 화염에 둘러싸인다","talkId":403810502,"textHash":"17708296695057850802","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:7/talk-403810502","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"074dd5d51512be8d","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-talk-403810503-line"],"bwikiPage":"焚化工","bwikiRevision":58640,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9305","bwikiMission":"소각공"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-talk-403810503-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-7","missionId":"event-rogue-7","mission":"소각공","scene":"소각공","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"수많은 기억들이 뇌리를 스쳐 지나가고 머리가 터질 것만 같다. 처음으로 손가락을 접으며 숫자를 세던 오후, 처음으로 우주 개미가 줄지어 길을 걷던 그때가 기억난다. 왜 이런 걸 기억하고 있는 걸까?","talkId":403810503,"textHash":"10622994548122652546","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:7/talk-403810503","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"074dd5d51512be8d","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"焚化工","bwikiRevision":58640,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9305","bwikiMission":"소각공"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-talk-403810507-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-7","missionId":"event-rogue-7","mission":"소각공","scene":"소각공","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「네가 살아있다는 걸 일깨워주는 이 쓰레기들을 잊지 마」 그녀가 냉소 섞인 말을 내뱉으며 강조한다. 「{RUBY_B#「기억의 에이언즈」}후리{RUBY_E#}를 믿도록 해. 우리가 네 어두운 기억을 소각할 테니까」","talkId":403810507,"textHash":"1278547267895101845","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:7/talk-403810507","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"8d93399d43294242","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"焚化工","bwikiRevision":58640,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9305","bwikiMission":"소각공"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-13080757261679302946-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-7","missionId":"event-rogue-7","mission":"소각공","scene":"소각공","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"「기억」의 에이언즈를 믿는다","talkId":null,"textHash":"13080757261679302946","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:7/text-13080757261679302946","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ecc8297be21dd334","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-2602198055189174340-effect"],"bwikiPage":"焚化工","bwikiRevision":58640,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9305","bwikiMission":"소각공"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-2602198055189174340-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-7","missionId":"event-rogue-7","mission":"소각공","scene":"소각공","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"★1~2 축복 1개를 버리고 「기억」 축복 1개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2602198055189174340","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:7/text-2602198055189174340","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ecc8297be21dd334","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"焚化工","bwikiRevision":58640,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9305","bwikiMission":"소각공","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-13080757261679302946-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-5300742815573427465-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-7","missionId":"event-rogue-7","mission":"소각공","scene":"소각공","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"잊고 싶은 「기억」을 불태운다","talkId":null,"textHash":"5300742815573427465","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:7/text-5300742815573427465","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e3eae0d204b57356","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-5067288190911951530-effect"],"bwikiPage":"焚化工","bwikiRevision":58640,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9305","bwikiMission":"소각공"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-5067288190911951530-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-7","missionId":"event-rogue-7","mission":"소각공","scene":"소각공","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"「공허」 축복 1개를 버리고 「공허」 축복 1개를 선택한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"5067288190911951530","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:7/text-5067288190911951530","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e3eae0d204b57356","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"焚化工","bwikiRevision":58640,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9305","bwikiMission":"소각공","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-5300742815573427465-choice"]}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-talk-403810501-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-talk-403810502-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-talk-403810503-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-talk-403810507-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-13080757261679302946-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-2602198055189174340-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-5300742815573427465-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-7-text-5067288190911951530-effect"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":8,"reviewRows":0,"segments":4,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}